  "description": "After Song Jeonghwa disappeared in Season 1 of \"[Delusion](https://mangabaka.org/series/0vxwvsu/delusion-hongjacga),\" a young man covered in blood is found in front of the Nammun Hotel, which Yun Iho runs while growing old alone. On his belongings is the name \"Kim Chunseok.\" Suffering from both amnesia and prosopagnosia, he is hired by Yun Iho as the final caregiver of his life. Yun Iho passes away, leaving behind a dying wish to deliver a painting to Song Jeonghwa. Tasked with finding Song Jeonghwa, Chunseok is left at a complete loss.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=857452), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14986250)",
